hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1158","Al-Rabi’ bin Sulayman Al-Muradi told us, Shuaib told us, Al-Layth told us, on the authority of Abdullah bin Ubayd Allah bin Abi Mulaika, on the authority of Ali bin Mamluk He asked Umm Salamah about the recitation of the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, and his prayers. She said: “And what about his prayers? He used to pray, then he slept for a period of time.” what he prayed, then he prays as much as he slept, then he sleeps as much as he prayed until morning,” and his recitation was described to him, so it is described as a recitation interpreted letter by letter."
